      {
        "id": 199225,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-21T17:57:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It would have been good to have all this detail in the bug report =)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Sorry, I try to send reports right away when I find them, because if I accidentally finish the game first, the Android app deletes my log. &nbsp;And it was a good thing this time too, because I didn't realize I had actually already lost the game and wouldn't even get another play.</p>\n<p>Maybe in a future update, you could make it so that you just overwrite the log the next time the player starts a new game, and not delete it immediately on game conclusion? &nbsp;It would be even better if the Send Feedback link could nab the current log automatically.</p>",
